    "A late dose doesn't undo your progress. If it's been a while, checking in with your prescriber is a good next step." : {
      "comment" : "A warning message that appears when the next dose is overdue.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A one-time purchase, billed through your Apple ID. Doesn't renew or expire." : {
      "comment" : "A footer that explains that the maintenance purchase is billed through Apple ID and doesn't renew.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una compra única, facturada a través de tu ID de Apple. No se renueva ni caduca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scannable recap of your last 7 days: dose adherence, protein average, and weight trend, plus 3 non-diagnostic AI findings on what it means." : {
